{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_2B1CD678","title":"Rosco 5","entry":"Dlg_2B1CD678::entry","exit":"Dlg_2B1CD678::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_C0FDD8B1","articyId":"72057752951736689","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"You haven't been shuffled into the sea by an apartment building then?","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You haven't been shuffled into the sea by an apartment building then?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":350.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42970","byteOffset":30586120,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_65C560AB","articyId":"72057752951736703","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Oh, great. Lay it on me.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, great. Lay it on me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":950.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42572","byteOffset":30434272,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_652FC321","articyId":"72057752951736715","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"So Curzona wasn’t just growing buildings and moving streets. They were growing ... themselves.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So Curzona wasn’t just growing buildings and moving streets. They were growing ... themselves.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47849","byteOffset":32437528,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_5BABDD35","articyId":"72057752951736729","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"…Clones? Like clones of who?","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"…Clones? Like clones of who?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17626","byteOffset":14557232,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_234728FA","articyId":"72057752951736744","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"And if they wiped it clean, that means something went wrong I assume?","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And if they wiped it clean, that means something went wrong I assume?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2700.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32485","byteOffset":20172576,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_019999AB","articyId":"72057752951736758","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Right. And here I am, some idiot mapping streets for a company that’s been rewriting reality whenever it suits them.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right. And here I am, some idiot mapping streets for a company that’s been rewriting reality whenever it suits them.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48996","byteOffset":32876520,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_8FC5CC40","articyId":"72057752951736771","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Unsettled? No, I’m just reevaluating my entire life. Twenty-five years indentured to a company that plays god, and I thought my biggest problem was getting lost in the lower districts.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Unsettled? No, I’m just reevaluating my entire life. Twenty-five years indentured to a company that plays god, and I thought my biggest problem was getting lost in the lower districts.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4500.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37408","byteOffset":28490936,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_1BDCE389","articyId":"72057752951736805","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"That’s the real question, isn’t it? I’ve got two choices. Keep my head down, pretend I never heard of this, and pray Curzona never decides I need to be erased… or—","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That’s the real question, isn’t it? I’ve got two choices. Keep my head down, pretend I never heard of this, and pray Curzona never decides I need to be erased… or—","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5100.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45284","byteOffset":31465688,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_38C87128","articyId":"72057752951736819","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Or I run. Get out of Nivalis. Try to disappear before they make me disappear.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Or I run. Get out of Nivalis. Try to disappear before they make me disappear.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5700.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32414","byteOffset":20144888,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_ADEB5EF1","articyId":"72057752951736833","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"But if I don’t try, I’ll wake up one day and find out I never existed at all. So what do you think? Do I stay? Or do I run?","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But if I don’t try, I’ll wake up one day and find out I never existed at all. So what do you think? Do I stay? Or do I run?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7675.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30327","byteOffset":19353248,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_22726F25","articyId":"72057752951736944","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"I think you're right.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think you're right.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":8575.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43629","byteOffset":30834144,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_CBCAD71A","articyId":"72057752951736968","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"I think you're right. I'm gonna make a break for it.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think you're right. I'm gonna make a break for it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":8575.0,"y":850.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26581","byteOffset":17936408,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_B10A2C36","articyId":"72057821671324673","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"No idea. I have never been out of Nivalis. Is there even something out there but the endless ocean?","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No idea. I have never been out of Nivalis. Is there even something out there but the endless ocean?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6300.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40354","byteOffset":29595520,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_A27C597D","articyId":"72057821671324696","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"It's okay. Not a lot of life to lose in the first place. And now at least I know I was important enough to get erased. Wish me luck!","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's okay. Not a lot of life to lose in the first place. And now at least I know I was important enough to get erased. Wish me luck!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":9175.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29220","byteOffset":18935184,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_C54EECDA","articyId":"72057821671324711","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"It's okay. Not a lot of life to lose in the first place. And now at least I know I was important enough for someone to hunt me down.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's okay. Not a lot of life to lose in the first place. And now at least I know I was important enough for someone to hunt me down.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":9175.0,"y":850.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34985","byteOffset":25594984,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_C6DA06F7","articyId":"72057606922887794","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"I've heard sailors talk about it like it was a pipe dream, as if it doesn't really exist.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I've heard sailors talk about it like it was a pipe dream, as if it doesn't really exist.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6900.0,"y":925.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43744","byteOffset":30879736,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_872EE1D4","articyId":"72057752951736696","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Rosco, I found out what The Cradle was.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Rosco, I found out what The Cradle was.","TextSheVersion":"Rosco, I found out what The Cradle was.","TextTheyVersion":"Rosco, I found out what The Cradle was."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":650.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50836","byteOffset":33572408,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_62341460","articyId":"72057752951736709","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Clones of Curzona’s executives.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Clones of Curzona’s executives.","TextSheVersion":"Clones of Curzona’s executives.","TextTheyVersion":"Clones of Curzona’s executives."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45334","byteOffset":31484376,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_104D0CBA","articyId":"72057752951736722","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"It was a nursery—for clones.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It was a nursery—for clones.","TextSheVersion":"It was a nursery—for clones.","TextTheyVersion":"It was a nursery—for clones."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1225.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28323","byteOffset":18597128,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_70E93079","articyId":"72057752951736737","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Yeah.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah.","TextSheVersion":"Yeah.","TextTheyVersion":"Yeah."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44433","byteOffset":31139688,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_AB95393A","articyId":"72057752951736751","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Probably.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Probably.","TextSheVersion":"Probably.","TextTheyVersion":"Probably."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18777","byteOffset":14990440,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_819B6707","articyId":"72057752951736764","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"We had to dig deep to uncover the data.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We had to dig deep to uncover the data.","TextSheVersion":"We had to dig deep to uncover the data.","TextTheyVersion":"We had to dig deep to uncover the data."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46243","byteOffset":31825912,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_3147194B","articyId":"72057752951736798","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So what are you gonna do?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So what are you gonna do?","TextSheVersion":"So what are you gonna do?","TextTheyVersion":"So what are you gonna do?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33811","byteOffset":20673432,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_507CCAD9","articyId":"72057752951736812","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Or?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Or?","TextSheVersion":"Or?","TextTheyVersion":"Or?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5400.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24169","byteOffset":17021672,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_77A529B5","articyId":"72057752951736826","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Can you even do that?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Can you even do that?","TextSheVersion":"Can you even do that?","TextTheyVersion":"Can you even do that?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6000.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17593","byteOffset":14545456,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_02ECA4B7","articyId":"72057752951736840","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'd stay, it's not worth the risk of being... you know.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'd stay, it's not worth the risk of being... you know.","TextSheVersion":"I'd stay, it's not worth the risk of being... you know.","TextTheyVersion":"I'd stay, it's not worth the risk of being... you know."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7975.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22684","byteOffset":16467176,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_493C572F","articyId":"72057752951736915","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Run, Curzona can't keep getting away with this stuff.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Run, Curzona can't keep getting away with this stuff.","TextSheVersion":"Run, Curzona can't keep getting away with this stuff.","TextTheyVersion":"Run, Curzona can't keep getting away with this stuff."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7975.0,"y":850.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25657","byteOffset":17590048,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_50E1186C","articyId":"72057752951736921","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"The right thing to do would be to pay Curzona back for your debts.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The right thing to do would be to pay Curzona back for your debts.","TextSheVersion":"The right thing to do would be to pay Curzona back for your debts.","TextTheyVersion":"The right thing to do would be to pay Curzona back for your debts."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":7975.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20212","byteOffset":15532248,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_EF036A6F","articyId":"72057821671324596","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"The Cradle ... we might have opened Pandoras Box there.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The Cradle ... we might have opened Pandoras Box there.","TextSheVersion":"The Cradle ... we might have opened Pandoras Box there.","TextTheyVersion":"The Cradle ... we might have opened Pandoras Box there."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":650.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47866","byteOffset":32443960,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_BFF146E0","articyId":"72057821671324604","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Cloned themselves so that they could follow themselves as executives.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Cloned themselves so that they could follow themselves as executives.","TextSheVersion":"Cloned themselves so that they could follow themselves as executives.","TextTheyVersion":"Cloned themselves so that they could follow themselves as executives."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47851","byteOffset":32438264,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_AEAC2BDE","articyId":"72057821671324612","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So it seems.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So it seems.","TextSheVersion":"So it seems.","TextTheyVersion":"So it seems."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52121","byteOffset":34133144,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_93D2282B","articyId":"72057821671324620","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Either way, they covered it up.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Either way, they covered it up.","TextSheVersion":"Either way, they covered it up.","TextTheyVersion":"Either way, they covered it up."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17069","byteOffset":14347776,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_02426019","articyId":"72057821671324643","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Rosco Foreman","text":"Okay, and the traces you left behind will lead to me. I was in that district.","speakerId":"Ntt_0FA5B8A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Okay, and the traces you left behind will lead to me. I was in that district.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21461","byteOffset":16006664,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_69716017","articyId":"72057821671324650","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You seem unsettled.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You seem unsettled.","TextSheVersion":"You seem unsettled.","TextTheyVersion":"You seem unsettled."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38686","byteOffset":28969632,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_B15DE950","articyId":"72057821671324658","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Can I help you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Can I help you?","TextSheVersion":"Can I help you?","TextTheyVersion":"Can I help you?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41137","byteOffset":29890968,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_B73E9F5C","articyId":"72057821671324666","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Where would you go?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Where would you go?","TextSheVersion":"Where would you go?","TextTheyVersion":"Where would you go?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demean